  "description": "Introducing the GoHype electric bike, perfect for urban riders seeking practicality and excitement in one compact package. This slim folding bike features a robust high-quality steel frame, and folds easily for convenient storage and transport. Equipped with a powerful 36V 350W integrated brushless wheel motor and a 36V 7.8AH Li-ion battery, the GoHype reaches a top speed of 20 mph (32 km/h) and offers a range of up to 20 miles per charge, making it ideal for both commuting and leisurely rides. The bike includes pedal assist mode and a twist throttle for fully assisted riding, giving you the flexibility to choose your riding style. The 16\" rubber tires ensure a smooth and stable ride, while the front and rear mechanical brakes with a power cut-off function provide reliable stopping power. Additional features include an LED display showing power, speed, voltage, mileage, and troubleshooting alerts, as well as front and rear lights for enhanced visibility. Weighing just 42 lbs (19 kg) and supporting riders up to 330 lbs (150 kg), the GoHype is light, easy to handle, and ready to make your commute more enjoyable. Experience the freedom and fun of the GoHype electric bike.\n\n20 mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 30 miles Range\n\n400 WHub Motor\n\n36V",
